  "description": "The Metropolitan II, our practical and reliable city bike, brings back the fun – now available in a new 29\" version for even more comfort and smoothness in everyday use. The durable Stratocrom steel frame forms the basis, while an integrated rear luggage rack combined with a front luggage rack with lights ensure maximum transport options.\n\nThun Zumba GBL 450 | Square taper | BSA 68mm\n\nMagura MT Sport | Hydraulic disc brake\n\nGates Carbon Drive CDC | 24T\n\nGates Carbon Drive CDN Centertrack belt\n\nGates Carbon Drive S150 | CDN 46T sprocket | 175mm\n\nShimano Alfine Inter-8 internal geared hub | Gates Carbon Belt Drive\n\nTout Terrain Super-C Fork II\n\nShutter PL-8 hub dynamo | Centerlock rotor interface\n\nShimano Alfine 8s Rapidfire Plus\n\nTout Terrain Ergo lock-on grips\n\nTout Terrain Comfort | 630mm | 35° backsweep\n\nAcros | EC34 / EC34\n\nBusch + Müller IQ-XS & Line Small rear light\n\nSKS Bluemels 60mm | XXL splash guard | black matte\n\nFront: Racktime TopIt Evo with Snapit | Rear: Tout Terrain Trekking Rack with Racktime Snapit\n\nShimano Alfine | SG-S7001-8 | 8-speed internal geared hub | Centerlock rotor interface\n\nTout Terrain | 100mm | +/- 6°\n\nMetropolitan steel frame | Tout Terrain Stratocrom tubing\n\n160 kg (frame) / 10 kg front, 40 kg rear (rack)\n\nTout Terrain VBA (eccentric bottom bracket)",
